            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. One (1) head football coach is allocated, and six (6) assistant football coaches shall be allocated for class 5A, and 4A schools, and class 3A, 2A, and 1A schools shall be allocated five (5) assistant football coaches. If there is no junior varsity football program, the assistant football coach's allocation shall be reduced by three (3) coaches. The classification shall be as determined by Florida High School Activities Association (FHSAA) Bylaws.",
